        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Eagle Aviation France\n- Places: Charles de Gaulle Airport, Paris, France\n- Topics: Wet lease operations, Airport identifiers\n\nFacts:\n- Eagle Aviation France based its wet lease operations in Paris at Charles de Gaulle Airport.\n- Charles de Gaulle Airport is also called Paris Charles de Gaulle Airport and Roissy Airport.\n- Charles de Gaulle Airport has the IATA code CDG and the ICAO code LFPG.\n- Charles de Gaulle Airport is the largest international airport in France.",
